    - Place target bar on opposite edge, with >= gap of 4 rows from source bar, >= 1 margin, source above target
    - Pick n_markers in [1, min(3, bar_height)]
    - Choose n_markers distinct offsets within [0, bar_height-1]
    - For each offset, place marker on source bar's row at a column >= 3 away from source bar, between the two edges
    - Verify all source-ray rows and target-ray rows are clear (guaranteed if no other objects placed)
    - Assemble input grid with red bars + teal markers on black background
